WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.760
An article like any other — plenty of claims, and no time to check them.

2
00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:11.040
Doppelcheck reads along and marks the load-bearing claims right in the text.

3
00:00:12.815 --> 00:00:17.935
Each claim is checked on its own, against independent sources

4
00:00:17.935 --> 00:00:19.615
and against existing fact-checks.

5
00:00:25.790 --> 00:00:29.070
Agreement and contradiction then appear on the text itself.

6
00:00:29.310 --> 00:00:31.230
Green where the sources agree.

7
00:00:31.470 --> 00:00:33.230
Red where they disagree.

8
00:00:34.270 --> 00:00:37.150
On its own, language processing runs on your device.

9
00:00:37.825 --> 00:00:42.305
If you choose a cloud API, requests go straight to that provider.

10
00:00:42.705 --> 00:00:45.105
Source search always goes to the open web.

11
00:00:46.145 --> 00:00:47.345
Keep reading.

12
00:00:47.505 --> 00:00:49.185
Just with the evidence beside it.

13
00:00:49.185 --> 00:00:50.545
doppelcheck.com
